@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3000
@reportId = 1

### Registrar usuario
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Ana López","email":"ana@example.test","password":"AguaSegura2026!","isNotificationEnabled":true}

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"ana@example.test","password":"AguaSegura2026!"}

### Crear reporte (reemplace fuga.jpg por la ruta de una foto real)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reports
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=AguaFixBoundary

--AguaFixBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="address"

Av. Reforma 120
--AguaFixBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Sale agua de la banqueta
--AguaFixBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="severity"

high
--AguaFixBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="reporterPhone"

5551234567
--AguaFixBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photo"; filename="fuga.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./fuga.jpg
--AguaFixBoundary--

### Consultar reportes con ambas URL
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports

### Cerrar reporte (reemplace reparacion.jpg por la ruta de una foto real)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/reports/{{reportId}}/resolve
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=AguaFixBoundary

--AguaFixBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photo"; filename="reparacion.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./reparacion.jpg
--AguaFixBoundary--

### Sin foto: 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{"address":"Av. Reforma 120","description":"Fuga","severity":"high","reporterPhone":"5551234567"}
